      en: ["The 1865 opening of the railway line was crucial for its development.", "Originally intended to be a center for agricultural production.", "Famous for the 'Banfield' football team based in the area.", "The cathedral's facade is decorated with two massive towers.", "Contains many historical English-style residential houses.", "The National University was founded in the region in 1972.", "Parque Municipal de Lomas is the largest of the city's parks.", "Peatonal Laprida is a key commercial promenade in the southern zone."],
