      en: ["Founded in the 19th century around the sugar industry.", "Known as the 'Pearl of the Ramal' due to its regional importance.", "Home to the historic 'La Esperanza' sugar mill.", "The city's carnival is famous for its 'corsos' and dance troupes.", "A major center for the production of oranges, lemons, and grapefruit.", "The climate is humid subtropical, significantly warmer than the capital.", "Hosts the annual 'Sugar Festival' celebrating local industry.", "An important logistical point on the route to Bolivia."],
